  "motion": "pull",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_049.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 50,
  "start": 159.586,
  "dur": 3.75,
  "text": "before your brain has properly registered that you're full.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "brainhq",
  "image": "images/beat_050.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 51,
  "start": 163.336,
  "dur": 1.667,
  "text": "Then suddenly, you're stuffed.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_051.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 52,
  "start": 165.003,
  "dur": 2.5,
  "text": "Doing this occasionally isn't a problem.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pan",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_052.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 53,
  "start": 167.503,
  "dur": 5.0,
  "text": "But regularly eating too quickly can contribute to overeating and weight gain.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "graphic",
  "image": "images/beat_053.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 54,
  "start": 172.503,
  "dur": 2.5,
  "text": "And that's not the only problem.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pull",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_054.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 55,
  "start": 175.003,
  "dur": 2.5,
  "text": "When you rush through a meal,",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_055.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 56,
  "start": 177.503,
  "dur": 3.333,
  "text": "you're also more likely to swallow extra air,",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "body",
  "image": "images/beat_056.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 57,
  "start": 180.836,
  "dur": 3.333,
  "text": "which can leave you feeling bloated and uncomfortable.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pan",
  "scene": "body",
  "image": "images/beat_057.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 58,
  "start": 184.169,
  "dur": 5.0,
  "text": "Also, taking large bites without chewing properly increases the risk of choking.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_058.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 59,
  "start": 189.169,
  "dur": 5.0,
  "text": "So yes, even something as ordinary as eating breakfast deserves more attention.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pull",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_059.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 60,
  "start": 194.169,
  "dur": 3.75,
  "text": "I'm not asking you to spend an entire afternoon",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_060.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 61,
  "start": 197.919,
  "dur": 2.083,
  "text": "eating one plate of food.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_061.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 62,
  "start": 200.002,
  "dur": 1.25,
  "text": "Just slow down.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pan",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_062.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 63,
  "start": 201.252,
  "dur": 2.083,
  "text": "Take smaller bites, chew properly,",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_063.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 64,
  "start": 203.335,
  "dur": 4.167,
  "text": "and give yourself a chance to notice when you're satisfied.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pull",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_064.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 65,
  "start": 207.502,
  "dur": 5.0,
  "text": "Great! Now that you've finished breakfast, it's time to head to work.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "kitchen",
  "image": "images/beat_065.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 66,
  "start": 212.502,
  "dur": 2.5,
  "text": "This is where another problem begins.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "office",
  "image": "images/beat_066.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 67,
  "start": 215.002,
  "dur": 4.167,
  "text": "Because for the next several hours, you might barely move.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pan",
  "scene": "office",
  "image": "images/beat_067.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 68,
  "start": 219.169,
  "dur": 2.083,
  "text": "Are you sitting right now?",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "fade",
  "scene": "office",
  "image": "images/beat_068.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 69,
  "start": 221.252,
  "dur": 3.333,
  "text": "How long have you been in that chair?",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pull",
  "scene": "office",
  "image": "images/beat_069.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 70,
  "start": 224.585,
  "dur": 2.5,
  "text": "An hour? Three hours? Since morning?",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "office",
  "image": "images/beat_070.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 71,
  "start": 227.085,
  "dur": 1.667,
  "text": "Sitting itself isn't bad.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "office",
  "image": "images/beat_071.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 72,
  "start": 228.752,
  "dur": 5.0,
  "text": "The problem starts when you spend most of your day barely moving.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pan",
  "scene": "office",
  "image": "images/beat_072.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 73,
  "start": 233.752,
  "dur": 5.0,
  "text": "You may have heard people say that sitting is the new smoking.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "office",
  "image": "images/beat_073.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 74,
  "start": 238.752,
  "dur": 1.667,
  "text": "Is that really true?",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pull",
  "scene": "graphic",
  "image": "images/beat_074.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 75,
  "start": 240.419,
  "dur": 2.917,
  "text": "Well, sitting isn't the same as smoking,",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "graphic",
  "image": "images/beat_075.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 76,
  "start": 243.336,
  "dur": 3.75,
  "text": "and the health risks shouldn't be treated as identical.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "graphic",
  "image": "images/beat_076.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 77,
  "start": 247.086,
  "dur": 2.083,
  "text": "But spending long periods inactive",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pan",
  "scene": "office",
  "image": "images/beat_077.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 78,
  "start": 249.169,
  "dur": 3.333,
  "text": "has been linked to some serious health problems.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "graphic",
  "image": "images/beat_078.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 79,
  "start": 252.502,
  "dur": 2.5,
  "text": "Including heart disease, type 2 diabetes,",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pull",
  "scene": "body",
  "image": "images/beat_079.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 80,
  "start": 255.002,
  "dur": 2.917,
  "text": "and a higher risk of early death.",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "graphic",
  "image": "images/beat_080.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 81,
  "start": 257.919,
  "dur": 2.083,
  "text": "I know you're probably thinking,",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "office",
  "image": "images/beat_081.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 82,
  "start": 260.002,
  "dur": 4.583,
  "text": "\"I woke up at 5 a.m. today, went to the gym,",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pan",
  "scene": "gym",
  "image": "images/beat_082.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 83,
  "start": 264.585,
  "dur": 1.667,
  "text": "exercised for an hour.\"",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "push",
  "scene": "gym",
  "image": "images/beat_083.png"
 },
 {
  "beat": 84,
  "start": 266.252,
  "dur": 1.25,
  "text": "Good for you!",
  "voice": "NARRATOR",
  "motion": "pull",
  "scene": "gym",
  "image": "images/beat_084.png"
 },
